<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sysco reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sysco reinstated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it reinstated Sysco Corp as a near and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
